    闪开 | shǎn kāi | dodge; get out of the way
    电脑 | diàn nǎo | computer
    电话 | diàn huà | telephone; phone call

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 闪电 specifically denotes the visual optical streak of atmospheric electrical discharge during a storm.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 闪电 vs. 雷 | léi | 闪电 is the visible optical flash of light, whereas 雷 is the audible acoustic rumble and sonic boom caused by atmospheric expansion.
    2 | 闪电 vs. 光芒 | guāngmáng | 闪电 is an episodic natural meteorological electrical discharge, whereas 光芒 refers broadly to steady or radiant rays of illumination from the sun, stars, or gold.
    3 | 闪电 vs. 火花 | huǒhuā | 闪电 is a massive atmospheric storm phenomenon, whereas 火花 refers to small physical sparks flying from friction, welding, or hearths.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 狂暴的风雨夜，闪电如利剑般一次次劈开苍穹，照亮了怒涛汹涌的海面。短暂的光芒虽只有一瞬，却让迷茫的水手看清了暗礁与航向。生命中的灵感往往如同闪电，唯有时刻做好准备的人，才能捕捉到那穿透迷雾的顿悟。 | Kuángbào de fēngyǔ yè, shǎndiàn rú lìjiàn bān yícìcì pīkāi cāngqióng, zhàoliàng le nùtāo xiōngyǒng de hǎimiàn. Duǎnzàn de guāngmáng suī zhǐyǒu yí shùn, què ràng mímáng de shuǐshǒu kàn qīng le ànjiāo yǔ hángxiàng. Shēngmìng zhōng de línggǎn wǎngwǎng rútóng shǎndiàn, wéiyǒu shíkè zuò hǎo zhǔnbèi de rén, cáinéng bǔzhuō dào nà chuāntòu míwù de dùnwù. | On tempestuous nights, lightning slashes heaven like blades, illuminating raging crests. Fleeting light lasts an instant, yet reveals reefs and course. Inspiration resembles lightning; only minds prepared seize insight piercing gloom. | En la noche tempestuosa, los rayos rasgan el cielo como espadas iluminando el mar furioso. Su fulgor dura un instante, mas basta para revelar arrecifes y rumbo. La inspiración asemeja al relámpago: solo quien está alerta atrapa la claridad que rasga la niebla.
  #2 | 物理观测表明，强对流云团中粒子碰撞引发电荷分离，当电场击穿空气时便产生耀眼的闪电。现代气象雷达能精准捕捉闪电频次，为极端暴雨预警与航空防雷提供了关键的数据支撑。 | Wùlǐ guāncè biǎomíng, qiáng duìliú yúntuán zhōng lìzǐ pèngzhuàng yǐnfā diànhè fēnlí, dāng diànchǎng jīchuān kōngqì shí biàn chǎnshēng yàoyǎn de shǎndiàn. Xiàndài qìxiàng léidá néng jīngzhǔn bǔzhuō shǎndiàn píncì, wèi jíduān bàoyǔ yùjǐng yǔ hángkōng fángléi tígōng le guānjiàn de shùjù zhīchēng. | Observations confirm particle collisions in clouds prompt charge separation, sparking brilliant lightning. Modern radar tracks strike frequencies, providing key data for severe storm warnings and aviation safety. | La observación física confirma que el choque de partículas en las nubes separa cargas y desata el rayo. Los radares rastrean las descargas, aportando datos clave para alertas de tormentas severas y seguridad aérea.
